Subject: [PATCH] Clean up website: fix GitHub Pages deploy, trim nav to
 Publications + CV
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Fix _config.yml: correct url (mikel-yu.github.io), repository, name,
  description, and linkedin fields — all were still set to template defaults
- Replace broken jekyll-build.yml (never deployed) with deploy.yml that
  builds Jekyll and publishes to GitHub Pages on every push to master
- Trim navigation to only Publications and CV tabs; CV tab links directly
  to the uploaded PDF (/files/Mikel_CV.pdf)
- Add Mikel_CV.pdf to files/
- Replace placeholder publication with two real entries (seismoacoustic
  SpaceX CRS-32 paper and B.Sc. thesis counterfactual explanations)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01H26PnfqU4VcePsP6Kcygtg
